<title>USA: CUC Intl had accounted for settlement.</title>
<headline>CUC Intl had accounted for settlement.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUC International Inc. confirmed that it had reached a $70.5 million settlement with former SafeCard Services Inc founder Peter Halmos.</p>
<p>When the company acquired SafeCard's successor, Ideon Group Inc, CUC had included the settlement costs in a charge it had taken in the third quarter of 1996, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>CUC acquired Ideon in August 1996.</p>
</text>
